<hr />
<p>The image is an edited/modified combination of these three images:</p>
<p>1. &quot;Bear hug&quot;<br />
Link: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bear_hug_(6360447621).jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bear_hug_(6360447621).jpg</a></p>
<p>2. &quot;Child hugging tree at Peravoor&quot;<br />
