<p>3. &quot;Deer at Night&quot;<br />
Link: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Deer_at_Night_(11425649114).jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Deer_at_Night_(11425649114).jpg</a></p>
<hr />
<p><strong>Edit:</strong> I've only discovered today that this SCP was actually translated into <a href="http://ja.scp-wiki.net/scp-4686">Japanese</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/c-dives" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2375337); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2375337&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572100451" alt="C-Dives" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2375337)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/c-dives" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2375337); return false;">C-Dives</a></span> and <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4686">Chinese</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eurya" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4369343); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4369343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572100451" alt="Eurya" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4369343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eurya" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4369343); return false;">Eurya</a></span>. Thank you both for translating it!</p>

