					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/silentsquirrel" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5673077); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5673077&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607200934" alt="silentsquirrel" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5673077)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/silentsquirrel" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5673077); return false;" >silentsquirrel</a></span> <span class="odate time_1569722674 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">29 Sep 2019 02:04</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4380457">
									

<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;My&nbsp;take&nbsp;on&nbsp;this</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Sadder&nbsp;than&nbsp;I&nbsp;thought</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>At first I thought this was a silly concept, since my mind went straight to <a href="/scp-botnik-j">SCP-\̅\̅\̅\̅-J</a> and the &quot;This is strictly limited to researchers who wish to be held&quot; footnote. I was going to give it a no-vote but I wanted to go back and re-read it first.</p>
<p>I got to the last block of entries again and <em>this</em> time I noticed what was going on, with the site itself being the requester and the name of the intended recipient. Then the footnotes&#8230;not going to lie, for how simple and straightforward this seems it still hit me on an emotional level I wasn't expecting.</p>
<p>So, have a +1, I need to go hug my dog.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Layout&nbsp;nitpick</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>I feel like in the second sentence of the containment procedures 'removed' and 'acquired' should be swapped, so the information is copied before removal. Also, amnesticizing everyone who accessed the site seems excessive, maybe limit it to the users who actually encountered a manifestation of SCP-4686-1?<br /></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

